  "body": "5 Bedrooms. 2 Living Areas. Double Garage. 408m² Freehold. BRAND NEW!\r\n\r\nBig family? Big plans? This home has room for both.\r\n\r\nWhy squeeze into a compact new build when you could have 228m² of brand-new living, a genuine backyard and space for the whole family?\r\n\r\nFive bedrooms, three bathrooms, two lounges and double garaging — plus a downstairs ensuite perfect for extended family.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is ready to sell. This could be the family upgrade you've been waiting for!\r\n\r\nRoom for everyone. Space for everything.\r\n\r\nForget homes where everyone is fighting for space. This beautifully designed, two-level home by Mars Living Construction gives growing and extended families the freedom to spread out, come together and enjoy everyday life without compromise.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers a private ensuite bedroom — ideal for grandparents, guests, independent teenagers or anyone working from home. With generous everyday living spaces, a modern kitchen and double internal-access garaging, practicality is built into every corner.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a second family lounge creates another valuable living zone, with direct access to the outdoor entertaining area and backyard.\r\n\r\nPicture the kids enjoying their own space while you unwind, weekend barbecues in the backyard, and family visiting without anyone feeling crowded.\r\n\r\nThis isn't just a bigger home. It's a better way to live.\r\n\r\nThe space you want. the extras you'll love.\r\n\r\n• 408m² freehold section — generous outdoor space and a genuine backyard\r\n\r\n• Approx. 228m² floor area — substantial, brand-new family living\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms — room for growing and extended families\r\n\r\n• 2 separate living areas — space to entertain, relax and enjoy privacy\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage — secure parking and everyday convenience\r\n\r\n• Downstairs ensuite bedroom — ideal for grandparents, guests or a home office\r\n\r\n• Upstairs family lounge — direct connection to the outdoor entertaining area and backyard\r\n\r\n• Central air-conditioning with individual room controls — personalised comfort for the whole household\r\n\r\n• Underfloor heating in bathrooms — extra warmth on cooler mornings\r\n\r\n• Bosch kitchen appliances — quality finishes and effortless everyday functionality\r\n\r\n• Built by Mars Living Construction — contemporary design with family practicality in mind\r\n\r\n• Brand new and ready to enjoy — move in without the renovation headaches\r\n\r\nThoughtful design. everyday luxury.\r\n\r\nA beautiful home should do more than look impressive. It should make everyday life easier.\r\n\r\nFrom the comfort of individually controlled air-conditioning to the luxury of heated bathroom floors, the specifications have been selected with real family living in mind.\r\n\r\nThe contemporary kitchen, complete with Bosch appliances, makes meal preparation and entertaining a pleasure, while the two separate living areas allow everyone to enjoy their own space.\r\n\r\nAnd when the sun comes out, the backyard provides something increasingly precious in modern new builds — room to relax, entertain and enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nLove the space. enjoy the orewa lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, welcoming extended family or looking to settle into a brand-new home on Auckland's beautiful Hibiscus Coast, this property delivers an appealing balance of space, comfort and location.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the relaxed coastal lifestyle that makes Orewa so popular, with its beachside atmosphere, local cafés, shops and everyday conveniences.\r\n\r\nWith convenient access to neighbouring communities such as Silverdale, Millwater and Red Beach, this is a location that combines coastal appeal with practical North Auckland living.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is ready to sell. are you ready to move?\r\n\r\nThere are plenty of brand-new homes on the market. But finding one with five bedrooms, two living areas, approximately 228m² of floor space, a 408m² freehold section, a proper backyard and double garaging is another story.\r\n\r\nHere, you don't have to choose between indoor comfort and outdoor space. You can have both.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is motivated and welcomes your offer.\r\n\r\nCome and experience the space for yourself — this could be the home your family has been waiting for.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nMore room to grow. More space to enjoy. More reasons to call Orewa home.",
